# `SCENE-KEYWORD-MEMBERSHIP`: the four cells WITHDRAWN from `flowchart`, each with the
# ground of its own cell in its own message:
#
#   group      one occurrence in the corpus, and it was this genre's OWN
#              reference figure, which exists to demonstrate every form of
#              every keyword — citing it as evidence of need is circular.
#   threshold  a threshold is drawn at a percentage of the target's RENDERED
#              EXTENT, and a process box's extent is an artifact of its label
#              length, so the line asserts nothing a reader can read.
#   band       a range over that same meaningless extent.
#   bundle     an ANTI-FEATURE here: parallel flowlines between two stages
#              are different CONDITIONS, and a ring round them hides what the
#              figure is for.
#
# `node` is NOT withdrawn and is written here to prove it: `GENRE-CONNECTOR-SPELLING`'s asymmetry
# keeps it in this genre, because a stage can have a role the source does not
# state and `node` is the only spelling for that. The KEEP half is 242.
figdown 0.2 flowchart
node a "A"
group g "G"
threshold "Budget" 60% in=a
band "Window" 10..20% in=a
bundle par a--a
